  "has_quantitative_results": true,
  "summary": "The paper proposes CryptoQNet, a hybrid quantum‑classical forecasting model using amplitude encoding, quantum feature maps, a variational quantum circuit, and a quantum recurrent neural network. On a simulator, it reports improved forecasting accuracy over classical models, achieving MAE/RMSE of 0.021/0.028 for Bitcoin and 0.018/0.025 for Ethereum, and volatility MAPE of 3.2% (BTC) and 3.6% (ETH). No quantum resource counts or computational speedup analysis are provided.",
